# PART 1 — PRODUCT IDENTITY

**Product:** FixGrid AI

**Tagline:** Connecting Communities. Empowering Innovators. Creating Impact.

**Secondary tagline:** Report. Resolve. Innovate.

**Official problem statement:** CivicPulse AI – Intelligent Civic Issue Management System.

**Category:** Web Development — PS-3.

**Team:** Kasukabe Defence Group.

## Product vision

FixGrid AI is an AI-powered civic issue management and community innovation ecosystem.

It connects citizens who report civic issues, government officials who manage and resolve complaints, and students, universities and industry partners who can contribute innovative solutions to validated civic challenges.

It is NOT merely a complaint registration portal.

It has two connected but separate workflows:

1. Official civic issue management and government resolution.
2. Community innovation and student project development.

The platform must clearly preserve the distinction between these workflows.

Student teams do not replace municipal repair or government service teams. Government officials retain authority over official complaints, challenge approval and public-sector pilots.

